        <mxCell id="m_note" value="Notes:&#10;• upperBound is server-stamped at /batches and echoed into every child's conf.&#10;• has_pages = No path skips trigger fan-out and goes straight to advance_cursor.&#10;• advance_cursor runs even if some children fail (sync-failure DAG owns replay).&#10;• max_active_runs=1 ensures cursor read-modify-write is serial across master runs." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=10;fontSize=11" vertex="1" parent="1">
